        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Flynn estate agents are delighted to bring Apartment 2, 69 Main Street, Lusk, to the open market for sale. Ideally positioned in the heart of Lusk Village, this well-presented 2 bed, 2 bath first-floor apartment offers comfortable and convenient living, with a wide range of local amenities and services right on the doorstep. Offering the perfect blend of comfort, convenience and accessibility, Apartment 2 is offered to the market with vacant possession and is available for immediate occupation and presents a superb opportunity for those seeking a home in this popular North County Dublin location. \n\nInternally, the accommodation is bright, spacious and thoughtfully laid out. A welcoming entrance porch leads into a generous open-plan kitchen, living and dining area, creating a modern and versatile space for both everyday living and entertaining. French doors open directly onto a west-facing patio, allowing for an abundance of natural light and providing a seamless connection between the indoor and outdoor living spaces. \n\nContinuing through the apartment, there are two generously proportioned double bedrooms. The main bedroom benefits from a private en-suite, while a well-appointed family bathroom completes the accommodation.\n\nIdeally positioned in the heart of Lusk Village, the apartment is within easy reach of a wide range of local amenities, including shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and sporting facilities. Excellent transport links, together with easy access to the M1, provide convenient connectivity to Dublin City Centre, Dublin Airport and the wider North Dublin area. Rush & Lusk Train Station is approximately 2km from the village centre, offering regular rail services to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. \n\n\nIdeally positioned in the heart of Lusk Village, the apartment is within easy reach of a wide range of local amenities, including shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and sporting facilities. Excellent transport links, together with easy access to the M1, provide convenient connectivity to Dublin City Centre, Dublin Airport and the wider North Dublin area. Rush & Lusk Train Station is approximately 2km from the village centre, offering regular rail services to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. \n"
      },
